     \"summary\": \"Rejected. The write-mix redesign is good, its numbers match, and FIND-O6-WRITE-SHAPE-01 closes. Two middle items replace it. FIND-O10-PRIMARY-SCALE answers the author's question: no, adopting FORCE PRIMARY is not shown beyond a 2 GB table near lab saturation, and at 100 writes\/s the fixed tolerance is not met against k. FIND-O10-INDEXED-100-STALL: an unexplained 66.8 s split and a whole-run write p95 of 1646.57 ms at 100 writes\/s are missing from the text. On 91: encrypted results now exist from a run outside this workflow, so §11 is stale; I would not make them decisive, since encrypted tables are out of scope, but the owner should decide and confirm that run is finished. Scripts 90, 91 and 92 are still of unknown origin to me.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 10,\n        \"role\": \"sol\",\n        \"summary\": \"Rejected。digest一致。新しいwrite-mixの実行と数値、現行カタログ51表一致、全5版の型、ENUM guard、複数チャネル拒否、1205を独立確認した。Opusのmiddle 2件を確認し、低い速度でのPRIMARY優位の表示も訂正が必要とした。STOP失敗はgrace内の復旧しか測っておらず、現行restore_applierが停止を観測しないままrestored=trueを返すためFIND-S8-REPLICA-STOP-FAILURE-01を再開した。公式文書の裏付けは前回と今回のSol原文確認で成立しFIND-DOC-01は閉鎖。後発manual-91の完結成功ログは確認したが、実行所有者や別PIDの現在状態は断定しない。DB接続・変更・委譲はしていない。\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 13,\n        \"role\": \"preserved-review-history\",\n        \"summary\": \"現在のSol rollout\/sampling\/validation\/frontier査読と28件の統合台帳を引き継ぐ。旧Opus記録は履歴だけで、新規承認は要求しない。\",\n        \"evidence\": [\"results\/reviews\/finding-register.json\", \"results\/reviews\/author-revision14-preserved-reviews.json\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"revision\": 14,\n        \"role\": \"author\",\n        \"summary\": \"DB接続・実験・テスト実行・委譲・別workflow起動なし。旧所有者中断ログと解放済みlockを確認後、reqscaleを30本へ分割して各方式3反復と300\/150秒上限を維持。旧3e\/3fをSHA付き引退台帳へ移し、matrix撤去・無効lock観測・semantic exitを修正。主文書206行。white-all、文書反映後監査、最終proofと別Sol査読は未完了。\",\n        \"evidence\": [\"results\/reviews\/author-revision14-verification.json\", \"bench\/requested\/primary-scale-plan.json\"]\n      },\n      